  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Child Rights Connect &amp; CRIN 2013 - 15</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Child Rights Connect &amp; CRIN 2013-2015 - NGO/CRIN 2013 - 15</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NGO Group/CRIN aim to improve implementation of the Convention of the  Right of the Child. The contribution is to NGO Group, cooperating    with CRIN in a joint application.                                      The focus is networking and a platform function to increase capacity of its member organisations and advocate for child rights.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NGO Group/CRIN verkar f&#xf6;r implementering av barnkonventionen. St&#xf6;d    utg&#xe5;r till NGO Group som samarbetar med CRIN, utg&#xe5;ende fr&#xe5;n en        gemensam ans&#xf6;kan.                                                      Verksamheten &#xe4;r n&#xe4;tverkande, plattformsfuntion f&#xf6;r b&#xe5;de              kapacitetsutveckling av medlemsorganisationer och p&#xe5;verkansarbete.</narrative>
  </description>
